cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Simulation code and results for the effect of electrode spacing on a laboratory-scale ionic thruster"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahesasb/ionic-thruster-electrode-spacing"
abstract: >-
  Reduced-order electrohydrodynamic model (charge simulation method, Peek onset,
  field-line space-charge current, ion-drag thrust) with Monte Carlo uncertainty
  and sensitivity analysis for a wire-to-tube-row ionic thruster. The results are
  model predictions and have not been validated experimentally for the modelled device.
keywords:
  - ionic thruster
  - corona discharge
  - electrode spacing
  - sparkover
  - Monte Carlo simulation
authors:
